<title>SINGAPORE: Jacks full year profit up 33 percent.</title>
<headline>Jacks full year profit up 33 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended January 31 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		2.72     vs    2.04</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	4.50     vs    4.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)     9.10     vs    6.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		277.10     vs  211.03</p>
<p>    Interest expense	2.28     vs    1.73</p>
<p>    Operating pretax	4.44     vs    3.46</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.88     vs    0.99</p>
<p>    Minorities	     (0.85)    vs   (0.42)</p>
<p>Note- Full name is Jacks International Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
